 In a few clicks, you can group data by different categories, apply filters,

9
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:50,240
 and create custom calculations. This makes it easy to get an overview of your data and identify

10
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:56,800
 patterns and trends. If we talk about Google Sheets, a Google Sheets offers a range of advanced

11
