 features that can help you manage and organize your data more efficiently. One of these features

12
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:08,960
 is data validation, which allows you to set rules for the types of data that can be entered

13
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:14,560
 into a cell. This can help prevent errors and ensure that your data is consistent.

14
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:21,760
 Google Sheets also offers add-ons that can extend its functionality, such as the merge values add-on,

15
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:27,280
 which allows you to combine values from different cells into one, if we move ahead to our next

16
