 For example, you highlight cells that contain values or apply color scale to show the relative

20
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:56,400
 values of your data. Zoho Sheet also offers the ability to create custom functions, which can help

21
00:01:56,400 --> 00:02:03,120
 automate repetitive tasks. The final software we will discuss today is Airtable. Airtable offers

